s deal +4 damage, stronger than grand klaive, AND decreases the claw attack roll difficulties by 1.<br /> Shouln't it decrease damage difficulty from 6 to 5 instead, rather than the attack roll?<br /> <br /> Anyway, my idea is to give the gift a +1 die for damage and a -1 difficulty on damage rolls, comparing it to BSD Toxic Claws which gives +1 die of damage and +1 difficulty on enemy soak rolls.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Too powerful for a rank 1 Gift&quot; is extremely shaky territory considering that Gifts partially run on spiritual affinities and sometimes Rank Three or even Four Garou Gifts end up as first rank Gifts for Fera (Catfeet for Bastet, for example, or Icy Chill of Despair for Ananasi and Gift of the Porcupine for Rokea).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T00:43:01-07:00","id":1311522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1311041-savagery-of-the-taloned-hunter-gift?p=1311457#post1311457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;Too powerful for a rank 1 Gift&quot; is extremely shaky territory considering that Gifts partially run on spiritual affinities an